    "result_text": "All green \u2014 build succeeds and the test passes. The audit log confirms a well-formed unified id: `memberId=NSW2716E6609E1` (REGION `NSW` + FY `27` + HASH8 `16E6609E` + Luhn CHK `1`).\n\n## Summary\n\nI unified `customerCode` and `membershipNumber` into a single `memberId` formatted `<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>`, and removed the derived `checkDigit` field.\n\n**Identity computation** \u2014 new `AssignMemberId` (replacing `AssignCustomerCode` + `AssignMembershipNumber`):\n- `REGION` from postcode/city (unchanged `Locality.of`), `FY` = 2-digit fiscal year of the business-day-adjusted registration date, `HASH8` = first 8 upper-hex of SHA-256 over normalized-telephone + lastName (same region-and-hash identity), `CHK` = single Luhn digit over the digits of `<REGION><FY><HASH8>`.\n- Collision handling now applies to `memberId` \u2014 appends `-<n>` (n\u22652) until unique, checking existing owners' `memberId`.\n\n**Fields/schema**:\n- `Owner`: `customerCode`/`membershipNumber` fields removed, replaced by `memberId` (column `member_id`).\n- All four dialect `schema.sql` files: `customer_code` + `membership_number` columns \u2192 single `member_id`.\n- `hsqldb/data.sql` positional INSERTs adjusted for the reduced column count.\n- `openapi.yml`: `customerCode`, `membershipNumber`, `checkDigit` schema entries removed; `memberId` added (this regenerates `OwnerDto`).\n\n**Downstream references now use `memberId`**:\n- `OwnerMapper`: dropped `checkDigit` mapping; `locality`/`timezone`/`ownerSegment` derive via new `Locality.ofMemberId` (extracts the leading letter run as REGION); `memberId` maps by name.\n- `AuditOwnerCreated`: audit line + `primaryIdentifier` now use `memberId`.\n- `OwnerCreatedEvent`: record component `customerCode` \u2192 `memberId`.\n- Pipeline YAML `owners.POST.yml`: single `assignMemberId` step.\n- `CheckDigit` retained (now computes the CHK segment); javadoc updated in `CheckDigit`, `Sha256`, `FiscalYear`.\n\n`mvnw test` \u2192 BUILD SUCCESS, 1 test passing.",
